      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is in the Snickers Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Real chopped Snickers® candy bar pieces containing roasted peanuts, caramel, nougat, and milk chocolate, blended thoroughly throughout Dairy Queen's signature vanilla soft serve.</div></div>
      </div>
